     three vmxnet3 adapters (one on the VGT trunk), one SR-IOV adapter, one
     dynamic DirectPath passthrough, a 60 GB thick disk, a two-level snapshot
     tree, latency sensitivity high with full reservations, a CPU affinity set
     and a curated extraConfig, EFI firmware with Secure Boot, an explicit
     boot order, vIOMMU on, hot-add off and Tools time sync off; its guest
